	(descr "Metal Lions MPN3012S series metal-alloy wire-wound shielded SMD power inductor, 3.0 x 3.0 x 1.2mm. Land pattern transcribed from the manufacturer datasheet 'Recommended Land Pattern' table: a (gap between pads) = 1.00, b (pad width) = 1.10, c (pad length) = 2.7, giving pad centres at +/-1.05mm. Authored rather than substituted because none of KiCad's three stock 3012 lands matches: L_Cenker_CKCS3012 has the right centres and length but 1.4mm-wide pads, which closes the inter-pad gap to 0.70mm under a conductive metal-alloy body; L_Abracon_ASPI-3012S and L_APV_ANR3012 both sit at +/-1.15mm centres. Used for L2, the RP2350 core buck inductor.")
